      "prefix_token_count": 214,
      "q": 0.813249520713251,
      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 3,
      "text": "Step 3: We need to find the square of the determinant of the matrix formed by these coordinates:\n\\[\n\\begin{vmatrix} x_1 & y_1 & 1 \\\\ x_2 & y_2 & 1 \\\\ x_3 & y_3 & 1 \\end{vmatrix}.\n\\]\nThis determinant represents twice the area of the triangle formed by points \\(A\\), \\(B\\), and \\(C\\).",
      "z": 1.471264585534441
    },
